# A play session for the owner at the first dungeon's boss, on R3's dual-run
# build (docs/NATIVE_R3.md): the existing renderer draws what is shown, and
# beside it the native PPFX renderer renders the same frames from PPFX's own
# calls and compares them -- every frame's final composite, and every PPFX
# draw of every 30th frame and of the 60 frames after the chain changes. What
# it adds to R3's coverage: the boss fight's own post-processing (and any
# magic attack's), which no automated route reaches.
#   SCENARIO=owner_boss_r3 build/venv/Scripts/python.exe tests/boot_smoke.py
# needs the development build (tools/r1_dev_lift.sh), copied to build/r3/play.
# A fresh copy of checkpoint dungeon1-boss-door each run (CONTINUE starts at
# the dungeon's door; the special key is in the room north of the north
# room), normal damage, sound, fullscreen. The comparison's results go to the
# run's ppfx_report.txt (build/sessions/boot-<time>-<tag>/), the saves the
# game writes to build/checkpoints/owner-boss-r3/.
#! saves build/checkpoints/dungeon1-boss-door
#! env BIN=build/r3/play/dotheroes.exe RUNS_IN=build/sessions KEEP_RUNS=1000 PREEMPT_TESTS=1
#! env DOTHEROES_PPFX_NATIVE=1 DOTHEROES_PPFX_REPORT=ppfx_report.txt DOTHEROES_PPFX_DUMP=ppfx_dump
#! env DOTHEROES_NATIVE_CD=1 DOTHEROES_NATIVE_SOLVER=4,5,6 GCM_WRAP_LAP=1 DOTHEROES_PRESENT_ONCE=1
#! env WINDOW=1 PS3RECOMP_VK_FULLSCREEN=1 AUDIO=1 PS3_OSD_FPS=2 DUMP=0 SHOT_EVERY=0 PS3_VERBOSE=0
#! env DOTHEROES_DEV_KEYS=1 DOTHEROES_DEV_STATE=1 DOTHEROES_DEV_RECORD=1 DIAG_FRAMES=frames.log
#! env PS3RECOMP_SPIRV_CACHE=build/play-boss/cache DOTHEROES_FPS=display
#! secs 14400
until_exit build/checkpoints/owner-boss-r3
